#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:40
msgid "Translation Caching"
msgstr "Itzulpenaren cachea"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:44
msgid ""
"Lingua Forge uses two independent caching layers to avoid redundant AI API "
"calls. Use the tabs below to inspect and manage each one."
msgstr ""
"Lingua Forge-k bi cache geruza independente erabiltzen ditu AI API deien "
"errepikapenak saihesteko. Erabil itxaronen azpi-atalak bakoitza aztertu eta "
"kudeatzeko."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:61
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:93
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:170
msgid "API Response Cache"
msgstr "API Erantzun Cachea"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:64
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:180
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:172
msgid "Translation Memory"
msgstr "Itzulpen Memoria"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:66
msgid "(disabled)"
msgstr "( desgaituta)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:76
msgid ""
"Per-post cache for AI-generated translations, meta descriptions, excerpts, "
"and content. Entries are invalidated automatically when the content or AI "
"provider/model changes."
msgstr ""
"Post bakoitzeko cachea AI-k sortutako itzulpenak, meta-deskribapenak, "
"laburpenak eta edukia. Sarrera automatikoki baliogabetzen da edukia edo AI "
"hornitzailea/modeloa aldatzen denean."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:103
msgid "Enable API response caching"
msgstr "Gaitu API erantzun cachea"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:106
msgid ""
"The API Response Cache stores the raw result of every AI request — "
"translation, meta description, excerpt, and content generation — keyed by a "
"hash of the inputs (content, language pair, provider, model). Disable during "
"prompt tuning or when you need every request to reach the AI provider. "
"Disabling does not delete cached entries — re-enabling restores them."
msgstr ""
"API Erantzun Cacheak AI eskaeraren emaitza gordetzen du — itzulpena, meta-"
"deskribapena, laburpena eta edukia — sarrera hash baten bidez giltzatuta "
"(edukia, hizkuntza bikotea, hornitzailea, modeloa). Gaitu ezazu prompt "
"tuning-ean edo eskaera bakoitza AI hornitzailearengana iristeko behar "
"duzunean. Desgaitzeak cacheko sarrerak ezabatzen ez ditu, berriro "
"aktibatzeak berreskuratzen ditu."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:111
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:198
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Gorde"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:117
msgid "Cached API responses"
msgstr "Cacheatutako API erantzunak"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:121
msgid "API calls saved by cache"
msgstr "Cache bidez gorde diren API deiak"

#. translators: %s is the average hits per cached entry.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:127
#, php-format
msgid "(avg %.1f hits/entry)"
msgstr "(batez beste %.1f deialdi/entry)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:135
msgid "Oldest cached response"
msgstr "Cacheatutako erantzun zaharrena"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:139
msgid "Most recent cached response"
msgstr "Cacheatutako erantzun azkena"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:149
msgid ""
"Clear all cached AI results? Future requests will trigger fresh API calls "
"until the cache rebuilds."
msgstr ""
"Ezabatu cacheko AI emaitza guztiak? Etorkizuneko eskaerak API deien berriro "
"exekutatzen ditu cachea berritzen den arte."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:153
msgid "Clear API Response Cache"
msgstr "Ezabatu API Erantzun Cachea"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:163
msgid ""
"Block-level translation cache shared across posts. When enabled, identical "
"blocks (same markup, language pair, and glossary) are served from memory "
"instead of calling the AI again. Glossary edits and Compliance preset "
"changes automatically invalidate affected cached translations."
msgstr ""
"Bloke mailako itzulpen cachea, post guztietan partekatua. Gaituta, bloke "
"berdinak (markaketa, hizkuntza bikotea, glosarioa) memoriaetik zerbitzatzen "
"dira AI berriro deitu gabe. Glosarioaren editaketak eta Konplaintzaren "
"aurreko ezarpenak automatikoki baliogabetzen dituzte cacheko itzulpenak."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:190
msgid "Enable block-level translation cache reuse across posts"
msgstr "Gaitu bloke mailako itzulpen cachearen berrerabilpena post guztietan"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:193
msgid ""
"Currently skipped for posts that use block-comment attribute placeholders "
"(wp:details summary fields, etc.) — they fall through to the existing single-"
"call translation path."
msgstr ""
"Une honetan ez da erabiltzen, bloke-argazki atributu placeholder-ak (wp:"
"details laburpen eremuak, etab.) erabiltzen dituzten postetan — existitzen "
"den deialdi bakarreko itzulpen bideari jarraitzen diote."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:204
msgid "Cached block translations"
msgstr "Cacheatutako bloke itzulpenak"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:208
msgid "Block translation reuses"
msgstr "Bloke itzulpen berrerabiltzen"

#. translators: %s is the average hits per cached block.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:214
#, php-format
msgid "(avg %.1f hits/block)"
msgstr "(batez beste %.1f deialdi/bloke)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:222
msgid "Oldest cached block"
msgstr "Cacheatutako bloke zaharrena"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:226
msgid "Most recent cached block"
msgstr "Cacheatutako bloke azkena"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:231
msgid "Approximate size"
msgstr "Tamaina aproximatua"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:240
msgid ""
"Clear the entire Translation Memory? Future translations will rebuild the "
"cache as they run."
msgstr ""
"Ezabatu Itzulpen Memoria osoa? Etorkizuneko itzulpenek cachea berriro "
"eraikiko dute euren exekuzioan."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:245
msgid "Clear Translation Memory"
msgstr "Ezabatu Itzulpen Memoria"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:304
msgid "API Response Cache setting saved."
msgstr "API Erantzun Cachearen ezarpena gorde da"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:312
msgid "Translation Memory setting saved."
msgstr "Itzulpen Memoriaren ezarpena gorde da"

