msgid "Flush Sitemap Cache"
msgstr "Hustu Maparen Cachea"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:184
msgid ""
"Forces the sitemap to regenerate on the next request. Use after bulk-"
"importing or manually editing translation relationships."
msgstr ""
"Bultzada ematen dio mapak hurrengo eskaeran berriz sortzeko. Erabili "
"masiboki inportatu edo itzulpen erlazioak eskuz editatu ondoren."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:190
msgid "IndexNow"
msgstr "IndexNow"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:194
msgid ""
"IndexNow is an open protocol supported by Bing, Yandex, and other search "
"engines. When a translated post is published or updated, Lingua Forge "
"automatically notifies all participating engines in a single push — no "
"polling, no waiting for the next robots.txt crawl."
msgstr ""
"IndexNow protokolo irekia da, Bing, Yandex eta beste bilaketa-motorrek "
"onartzen dute. Post bat itzulita edo eguneratuta, Lingua Forge-k "
"automatikoki jakinarazten die motor guztiei — ez dago polingik, ez itxaron "
"robotak.txtaren arakatze hurrenkerara."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:202
msgid ""
"IndexNow replaces the deprecated Bing and Yandex sitemap-ping endpoints. "
"Google discovers sitemaps via the robots.txt Sitemap: directive as before."
msgstr ""
"IndexNow-k ordeztu du Bing eta Yandexen mapa-ping endpoints zaharra. Google-"
"k mapak ezagutzen ditu robots.txt Sitemap: direktiboa erabiliz, aurreko "
"moduan."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:219
msgid "✓ All URLs submitted to IndexNow successfully."
msgstr "✓ Guztiz URLak IndexNow-era bidali dira arrakastaz."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:223
msgid ""
"No translated URLs found to submit. Publish some translated posts first."
msgstr ""
"Ez dago bidaltzeko itzulitako URLik. Lehenik, posta itzulitako batzuk "
"argitaratu."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:227
msgid ""
"✗ IndexNow submission failed. Check that the key file is publicly reachable "
"(see below) and try again."
msgstr ""
"✗ IndexNow bidalketa huts egin du. Egiaztatu giltza fitxategia publikoan "
"dagoela (ikus behean) eta saiatu berriro."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:233
msgid "Verification key"
msgstr "Egiaztapen giltza"

#. translators: %s: key file URL
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:241
#, php-format
msgid "Key file served automatically at: %s"
msgstr "Giltza fitxategia automatikoki zerbitzatzen da: %s"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:247
msgid ""
"Key could not be generated. Check that the site has write access to "
"WordPress options."
msgstr ""
"Giltza ezin izan da sortu. Egiaztatu WordPress aukerak idazteko aukera duela."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:252
msgid "Key file status"
msgstr "Giltza fitxategiaren egoera"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:257
msgid "✓ Key file is publicly reachable."
msgstr "✓ Giltza fitxategia publikoan dagoela."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:259
msgid "✗ Key file is not reachable."
msgstr "✗ Giltza fitxategia ez da iristekoa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:261
msgid ""
"IndexNow engines verify the key file before accepting submissions. If the "
"file is not reachable, submissions will be rejected with a 403 error."
msgstr ""
"IndexNow motorrek giltza fitxategia egiaztatzen dute aurretik eskaerak "
"onartzeko. Fitxategia ez bada iristekoa, eskaerak 403 errorearekin "
"baztertuko dira."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:264
msgid ""
"Common causes: full-page caching (clear it), a security plugin blocking .txt "
"files, or a custom Nginx/Apache rule. The file is served by LF on every "
"request — no physical file is written to disk."
msgstr ""
"Arrazoi ohikoak: cache osoa (garbitu), segurtasun plugin batek .txt "
"fitxategiak blokeatzen ditu, edo Nginx/Apache arau pertsonalizatua. "
"Fitxategia LF-k zerbitzatzen du eskaera bakoitzean — ez dago fitxategi "
"fisikorik diskoan."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:270
msgid "Submit all URLs"
msgstr "Bidali URL guztiak"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:276
msgid "Submit all URLs via IndexNow"
msgstr "Bidali URL guztiak IndexNow bidez"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:280
msgid ""
"Pushes every published, LF-managed URL to IndexNow in one batch. Automatic "
"submission already runs on every publish/update — use this only after a bulk "
"import or when setting up IndexNow for the first time."
msgstr ""
"Bidali denbora guztian, LF-k kudeatutako URL guztiak IndexNow-era "
"inbentariatzen ditu. Bidalketa automatikoa denbora guztian egiten da — "
"erabili hau inportazio masibo bat egin ondoren edo lehen aldiz IndexNow "
"konfiguratu duzunean."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:289
msgid ""
"Google does not participate in IndexNow. It discovers sitemaps via the "
"robots.txt Sitemap: directive — which LF has already configured. Use Google "
"Search Console to monitor indexing coverage."
msgstr ""
"Google ez da parte hartzen IndexNow-n. Mapak ezagutzen ditu robots.txt "
"Sitemap: direktiboa erabiliz — LF-k dagoeneko konfiguratuta du. Erabili "
"Google Search Console indexazioaren hedadura zaintzeko."

