"No published post or page found to test with — publish some content first, "
"or try Quick Translate directly."
msgstr ""
"Ez da argital edo orri argitaratuta aurkitu proba egiteko — argitaratu eduki "
"batzuk lehenago, edo saia zaitez Quick Translate zuzenean."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:448
